#
# Feedback form: where players' feedback is sent, so it reaches your email.
# 1. Make a free account at https://formspree.io and create a form with your email.
# 2. Copy the form's endpoint (it looks like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz) here.
# 3. Restart `npm run dev`.
VITE_FEEDBACK_URL=
